# Styling

Use CSS variables for palette and spacing. Match mockups in `../frontend-engineer/assets/` without chasing pixel perfection.

## Tokens (targets)

- Side margin: 24px; bubble gap: 16px; bubble padding: 16px; composer padding: 8px
- Bubble max-width ~640px (percentage-based on mobile)
- Incoming: white bubble, show author + body + timestamp (left)
- Outgoing: pale yellow (~`#FCF6C5`), body + timestamp only (right)
- Footer bar: ~`#3798D4`; Send: ~`#FF876D`
- Background: tile `Body BG.png` from `public/`

Avoid card-heavy redesigns, purple/indigo AI defaults, and unnecessary shadow stacks.
